 23	   2.2 Sourcing War Room — paste a multi-role brief, launch N campaigns that
 24	   source in parallel. Offline-safe by construction:
 25	     - Role blocks are split on a line of `---` (pure string parsing, no I/O).
 26	     - parseIntakeLive already carries its own three-layer fallback (mock-ai.ts
 27	       heuristic is canonical whenever no cloud provider is configured).
 28	     - Sourcing runs via sourceNextBatch with platform "Talent Pool", which is
 29	       the one branch of sourceNextBatch that never calls `/api/source` — it
 30	       goes straight to the deterministic synthetic generator (see the
 31	       Referral/Talent Pool branch, store.ts sourceNextBatch). No network,
